    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1015">

                <pb facs="1521" n="1507" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg1507"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.711/74: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-03-17T16:00:00-04:00">March 17, 1944—4
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2021. For Phillips. Embassy’s 1878, March 8, 5 p.m. Our feeling is that
                    censorship should be based solely on military considerations and should not be
                    used for any other purpose.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
